#
# ✒ Description:
#     Keeps every text file LF in the repository and in the working tree,
#     whatever core.autocrlf says on the machine, and marks binary assets so
#     Git never touches them.
#
# ✒ Key Features:
#     - LF everywhere, which the shipped modules and tools already use.
#     - Font and image assets are binary.
#
# ✒ Other Important Information:
#     - Dependencies: none
#     - Compatible platforms: Git 2.x on any OS
# ---------

* text=auto eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.webm binary

